Caution: We will see later that in our general setting the tangent space of an object $A \in \mathcal{C}_\Lambda $ over $\Lambda $ should not be defined simply as the $k$-linear dual of the relative cotangent space. In fact, the correct definition of the relative cotangent space is $\Omega _{S/R} \otimes _ S S/\mathfrak m_ S$.